    "## Data Augmentation and Image Generators\n",
    "\n",
    "To improve model generalization and prevent overfitting, we apply **data augmentation** to the training dataset.  \n",
    "This helps the model learn from a wider variety of image transformations such as rotations, shifts, zooms, and flips.\n",
    "\n",
    "We use the `ImageDataGenerator` class from Keras to:\n",
    "- **Rescale** pixel values to the `[0, 1]` range  \n",
    "- Apply **random transformations** (rotation, zoom, flip, brightness, etc.) to training images  \n",
    "- Keep **validation** and **test** images unaltered except for rescaling  \n",
    "\n",
    "The generators below automatically load images from each directory and prepare them for training in batches."
   ]
  },
