    "## Model Training\n",
    "\n",
    "With the model fully defined and compiled, we can now start the training process.\n",
    "\n",
    "We train the CNN for up to **50 epochs** using:\n",
    "- **Training data generator** → provides augmented images  \n",
    "- **Validation data generator** → monitors validation accuracy and loss  \n",
    "\n",
    "During training, we apply the callbacks defined earlier:\n",
    "- `EarlyStopping` → stops training early if validation loss doesn’t improve  \n",
    "- `ModelCheckpoint` → saves the best-performing model as `best_model.keras`  \n",
    "- `ReduceLROnPlateau` → dynamically adjusts the learning rate when progress slows  \n",
    "\n",
    "The training history is stored in the `history` object for further visualization and analysis.\n"
   ]
